-# Odznaki. One controller action, two screens: the teacher's editable grid
-# (#/t/badges, 30-lists.js:30-33) and the student's deck of flip cards
-# (#/s/badges, 30-sp.js:25-28).
-#
-# The persona comes from MEMBERSHIP, resolved in the controller through the
-# same GroupChrome the navigation uses — so this page and the deck
-# beside it can never disagree about who you are here.
- content_for :title, 'Odznaki'

- if @shelf.membership
  = render 'student_deck', shelf: @shelf
- else
  = render 'teacher_grid', shelf: @shelf
